<title>USA: Pinnacle Systems to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Pinnacle Systems to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pinnacle Systems Inc said Wednesday its board of directors has approved a stock buyback of up to 750,000 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement its stock price is at attractive levels adding that the buyback will reduce potential long-term dilution of earnings per share resulting from issuing stock under it's stock benefit plans.</p>
</text>
